{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>美股三大指數低開後個別發展。</p><p></p><p>標準普爾500指數和納斯達克指數早段走勢偏軟。道瓊斯工業平均指數輕微低開後逐步回升。</p><p></p><p>科技股繼續下跌，晶片股輝達、美光科技和閃迪，早段跌約百分之1至2。雲服務公司CoreWeave急挫約半成。收市後將公布業績的太空探索公司SpaceX跌逾百分之2。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T14:40:58.003407+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T14:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T14:38:18.697648+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T14:38:18.697648+00:00","content_hash":"78df7ea74cd992ce7344853e4ccd9a95ae3f3e0398d809f3fdc75cb342f080ab","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}